## 🛠️ Commandes et Code utiles (Module 3)

**Initialiser un projet dbt :**
```bash
# Installation
pip install dbt-bigquery

# Initialiser le projet dans le dossier courant
dbt init de_zoomcamp_dbt
```

**Commandes d'exécution dbt :**
```bash
# Tester la connexion à BigQuery
dbt debug

# Exécuter tous les modèles
dbt run

# Exécuter un modèle spécifique et ses dépendances
dbt run --select stg_green_tripdata+

# Lancer les tests de qualité de données
dbt test

# Générer et visualiser la documentation
dbt docs generate
dbt docs serve --port 8081
```

**Exemple de modèle dbt (`fct_trips.sql`) avec partitionnement et incrémentiel :**
```sql
{{ config(
    materialized='incremental',
    partition_by={'field': 'pickup_datetime', 'data_type': 'timestamp'},
    cluster_by=['pickup_location_id']
) }}

WITH stg_trips AS (
    SELECT * FROM {{ ref('stg_green_tripdata') }}
),
dim_zones AS (
    SELECT * FROM {{ ref('dim_zones') }}
)

SELECT
    t.trip_id,
    t.pickup_datetime,
    t.dropoff_datetime,
    t.trip_distance,
    t.total_amount,
    z_pickup.zone_name AS pickup_zone_name,
    z_dropoff.zone_name AS dropoff_zone_name
FROM stg_trips t
LEFT JOIN dim_zones z_pickup
    ON t.pickup_location_id = z_pickup.location_id
LEFT JOIN dim_zones z_dropoff
    ON t.dropoff_location_id = z_dropoff.location_id

{% if is_incremental() %}
  -- Ne charger que les nouveaux trajets si la table existe déjà
  WHERE t.pickup_datetime > (SELECT MAX(pickup_datetime) FROM {{ this }})
{% endif %}
```

**Exemple de Flow Kestra pour exécuter dbt (`dbt_pipeline.yaml`) :**
```yaml
id: run_dbt_transformations
namespace: de_zoomcamp_module_3

tasks:
  - id: clone_repo
    type: io.kestra.plugin.core.git.Clone
    url: https://github.com/votre-utilisateur/de_zoomcamp_dbt
    branch: main
    
  - id: dbt_deps
    type: io.kestra.plugin.scripts.shell.Commands
    containerImage: ghcr.io/dbt-labs/dbt-bigquery:latest
    workingDir: "{{ outputs.clone_repo.directory }}"
    commands:
      - dbt deps
      
  - id: dbt_run
    type: io.kestra.plugin.scripts.shell.Commands
    containerImage: ghcr.io/dbt-labs/dbt-bigquery:latest
    workingDir: "{{ outputs.clone_repo.directory }}"
    env:
      # Authentification via la variable d'environnement DBT_ENV_SECRET_GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT
      DBT_ENV_SECRET_GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT: "{{ secret('GCP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON') }}"
    commands:
      - dbt run --profiles-dir .
      
  - id: dbt_test
    type: io.kestra.plugin.scripts.shell.Commands
    containerImage: ghcr.io/dbt-labs/dbt-bigquery:latest
    workingDir: "{{ outputs.clone_repo.directory }}"
    env:
      DBT_ENV_SECRET_GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT: "{{ secret('GCP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON') }}"
    commands:
      - dbt test --profiles-dir .
```

